{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》正播得如火如荼，29歲前港姐亞軍陳楨怡於劇中化身機心女總編，強勢介入陳展鵬與傅嘉莉婚姻引 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》正播得如火如荼，29歲前港姐亞軍陳楨怡於劇中化身機心女總編，強勢介入陳展鵬與傅嘉莉婚姻引發全城熱話。入行短短幾年便屢次挑戰高難度破格角色，不但與男主角上演火辣親密戲碼，更連續4年穩坐台慶劇要角寶座。這位高學歷女神備受公司極度力捧背後，隱藏著超乎觀眾想像全盤演藝野心。</p>\n<h2>陳楨怡玫瑰戰爭演小三床戰陳展鵬</h2>\n<p>在熱播台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》劇情發展進入白熱化階段，陳楨怡飾演雜誌社總編楊素希徹底顛覆過往乖乖女形象。劇中她毫不忌諱地介入富二代何家俊與妻子菲雅之間，不僅展現出極具心機與算計立體性格，更與飾演人夫陳展鵬上演連場尺度極大親密互動，甚至流出震撼眼球床照。這場挑戰道德底線戲碼成功將角色機關算盡與情緒張力具體呈現於螢幕前。</p>\n<h2>港姐亞軍陳楨怡屢接台慶劇獲力捧</h2>\n<p>翻開其入行履歷表，擁有倫敦大學學院建築系學位與精通豎琴才華，自2020年奪得港姐亞軍後便火速成為劇組搶手貨。近年她頻頻在重頭劇中交出亮眼成績單，由《新聞女王》聶莎莎、《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》寧俐到《巨塔之后》中怒罵鍾鎮濤兼掟玻璃杯爆發性演出，連續4年強勢參與台慶劇。據悉她更已落實參演2027年由袁詠儀擔綱重頭劇《模仿人生》。</p>\n<h2>陳楨怡暑假拍《浪花男女》 與張振朗女友有對手戲</h2>\n<p>陳楨怡近年積極向電影圈發展，繼早前獲邀參演古天樂主演的賀歲電影《臨時決鬥》後，今年暑假再有機會參與電影《浪花男女》拍攝，與張振朗女友楊偲泳（Renci）有對手戲，演藝事業逐步向大銀幕拓展。據悉，古天樂亦相當看好陳楨怡的演藝潛力，令她在影視雙線發展上備受關注。由電視劇逐步進軍電影界，陳楨怡接連獲得不同類型的演出機會，未來發展令人期待。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚陳楨怡演技突飛猛進惹熱議</h2>\n<p>隨著劇集熱播與多個破格角色接連出街，公眾對這位昔日選美佳麗印象已徹底改觀，社交平台上湧現大量正面評價。不少觀眾留意到她放低女神包袱，紛紛留言大讚「演技明顯進步咗好多」、「做反派真係入型入格好有驚喜」，甚至有人認同她完全駕馭到專業人士氣場。網上論壇亦有不少帖文支持她勇於跳出舒適圈，並留下「充滿衝突感角色更適合佢」、「完全展現到演員潛力」等鼓勵性字句。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247373636436_2420506426af468aa4897f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6314524475965248677_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247373636436_2420506426af468aa4897f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡今次在《玫瑰戰爭》中大膽突破形象，飾演心機極重的雜誌社總編楊素希。（圖片來源：《玫瑰戰爭》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2990671806-1_4820516196af46ba7e0571-1024x857.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"803\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-tvbjadehongkongtimezonetvbanywhere-2990671806-1_4820516196af46ba7e0571-1024x857.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《玫瑰戰爭》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176363501419090619_1883825376691eef46837e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"新聞女王2｜陳楨怡再現身成關鍵人物回顧第一季與「思覺大叔」互動掀高潮\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176363501419090619_1883825376691eef46837e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡早前在《新聞女王》中飾演聶莎莎，已令不少觀眾留下深刻印象。（圖片來源：《新聞女王2》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247513287094_13361192126af468abeb412.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"巾幗梟雄之懸崖｜前港姐亞軍陳楨怡飾演角色寧俐民初超貼身旗袍晒逆天長腿| UHK 港生活\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247513287094_13361192126af468abeb412.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>在《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》飾演角色寧俐民初超貼身旗袍晒逆天長腿（圖片來源：《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247625377377_10974297906af468aca2e83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6314524475965248678_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247625377377_10974297906af468aca2e83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡在《巨塔之后》一改溫柔形象，激烈演出令觀眾刮目相看。（圖片來源：《巨塔之后》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247781721293_9188869206af468ae4428c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6314524475965248679_x.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247781721293_9188869206af468ae4428c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡早前獲邀參演古天樂主演的《臨時決鬥》，正式踏足大銀幕。（圖片來源：IG@celina_harto）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247875580744_5581990576af468af3eb44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20250916163324_6500629576b2209286f7127d0d3cc61b729e9420.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247875580744_5581990576af468af3eb44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡於2020年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍，憑出眾外貌及高學歷背景受到注目。（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247980382132_13210434316af468b02f083.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 697767.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440247980382132_13210434316af468b02f083.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440248177637269_11914607816af468b2524fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 949257.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440248177637269_11914607816af468b2524fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440248537152918_6464317776af468b5ea3df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 3653872.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440248537152918_6464317776af468b5ea3df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%87%a8%e6%99%82%e6%b1%ba%e9%ac%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">臨時決鬥</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%a5%a8%e6%80%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳楨怡</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540618\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:20.514699+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1570,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:45:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:43.776480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:50.719525+00:00","content_hash":"fb60e0689bd53e6df4419b2e783644f42d1767a710be74d8548118359a829f4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}